  "description": "1.6.1.0 plus n°29: the 8 beat-wide positions (All Osc Freq, Feedback, LP Freq, Resonance, Audio Mod, HP Freq, Attack, Decay) are sent after any panel action that changes them (16 Beats / 16 Mutes knobs, Beat FX soft knobs, Revert key, sliders; physical or remote panel) and after a beat change, as CC 20-27 = position >> 1, plus CC 52-59 = 0x40 when the position is odd, on Remote Pad OUT. The same bytes set them (CC 20-27 stock, CC 52-59 new), without echo; CC 107 also resends them. Voice, Panel and SAM unchanged.",
